<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PatrolLink - Security Management Platform</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/logo.png" type="image/x-icon">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: #0f172a;
    }
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: url('/images/hero.webp') center center / cover no-repeat;
    }
    .hero-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5) 50%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75) 100%);
    }
    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 720px;
    }
    .hero-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hero-logo img {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .hero-logo span {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.25rem;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }
    .hero h1 span { color: #60a5fa; }
    .hero p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      max-width: 540px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: #2563eb;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      border: 1.5px solid #334155;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #60a5fa; color: #fff; }
    .btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
    .hero-status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.25);
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #22c55e;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .hero-status svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
    .section {
      padding: 100px 20px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .section-header p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 32px;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      border-color: #334155;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .feature-card-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      color: #60a5fa;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .feature-card p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
      padding: 48px 20px;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .footer-links a {
      color: #64748b;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #94a3b8; }
    footer .copyright {
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1rem; }
      .hero-logo span { font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .section { padding: 60px 20px; }
      .section-header h2 { font-size: 1.75rem; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-logo">
        <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="PatrolLink">
        <span>PatrolLink</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-status">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
        API Live
      </div>
      <h1>Security <span>Management</span> Platform</h1>
      <p>Real-time patrol management, guard tracking, and comprehensive security oversight for your organization.</p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/><polyline points="10 17 15 12 10 7"/><line x1="15" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/></svg>
          Sign in
        </a>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-secondary">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="20" y1="8" x2="20" y2="14"/><line x1="23" y1="11" x2="17" y2="11"/></svg>
          Create account
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Everything you need</h2>
      <p>Tools and features to keep your security operations running smoothly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <svg class="feature-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
        <h3>Real-time Guard Tracking</h3>
        <p>Monitor guard positions and patrol routes live. Ensure full coverage across all your sites with GPS-enabled tracking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <svg class="feature-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
        <h3>Shift &amp; Assignment Management</h3>
        <p>Create and assign patrol shifts, manage guard schedules, and track completion status from a single dashboard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <svg class="feature-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        <h3>Role-based Access Control</h3>
        <p>Granular permissions for admins, supervisors, and guards. Each role sees exactly what they need to do their job.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <svg class="feature-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        <h3>Incident Reporting</h3>
        <p>Guards can report incidents instantly with photos, GPS coordinates, and notes. Supervisors are notified in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <svg class="feature-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
        <h3>Analytics &amp; Reporting</h3>
        <p>Comprehensive reports on patrol completion, guard performance, incident trends, and operational metrics.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <svg class="feature-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
        <h3>RESTful API</h3>
        <p>Complete API for integrating with your existing systems. Built with Express.js and backed by PostgreSQL.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/documentation">Documentation</a>
        <a href="/api-endpoints">API Endpoints</a>
        <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
      <div class="copyright">&copy; PatrolLink</div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>